# Greedy Freebooter: the scry is a "may". Bot2 bolts the Freebooter and Bot1 keeps the top card (an Island) on top
# (nothing on the bottom), so the library is unchanged and Bot1 draws that Island on its next turn. The Treasure token is
# real mana: on turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices it for {B} and casts a second Freebooter with it, along with no land drop.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Greedy Freebooter
Greedy Freebooter
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains
Island
Forest
Swamp
Plains
Plains

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Greedy Freebooter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Greedy Freebooter)
Bot1.Arrange(Island | )
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Greedy Freebooter.Cast
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Greedy Freebooter
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Greedy Freebooter
Bot1.Hand = Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Island
